DAMN is an original game in the 90s first-person-shooter genre. Its levels,
characters, weapons, textures, sprites, font, sound effects, music and jokes
are all generated by this repository's own code. It contains no assets, maps,
names or code from any commercial or community game, and is not affiliated
with any of them.

Reused QSOLKCB code (Apache-2.0):
  - VANILLAJS: FixedClock (modules/time) via Bullet-Time's src/clock.js, and
    FrameGate (modules/frame-gate), copied unchanged into src/frame-gate.js.
  - QUICKSCOPER / Bullet-Time: seeded RNG, synthesized Web Audio structure,
    lifecycle and offline service-worker patterns.
OPT patterns applied: OPT-INV-001 (art generated once, reused buffers, shared
enemy flow field recomputed only when the player changes cell or a door moves),
OPT-BUDGET-001 (simulation budget test).
